## Commands

- Build Android: `./gradlew :composeApp:assembleDebug`
- Tests: `./gradlew :composeApp:allTests`
- iOS: open `iosApp/iosApp.xcodeproj` in Xcode (signing team in `iosApp/Configuration/Local.xcconfig`)
{%- if include_desktop %}
- Desktop: `./gradlew :composeApp:run`
